# Keep LF line endings on every platform, including Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true).
# tests/test_given_engine.py checks that the debug_lab incident bundles regenerate
# byte-for-byte, and the generator writes LF; a CRLF checkout would fail that gate.
# Shell scripts in gpu/ must also stay LF to run under bash or WSL.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
